WEBVTT

00:01:29.470 --> 00:01:34.710
amounting to a shadow pandemic
that we are now faced with globally.

00:01:34.750 --> 00:01:37.930
In France for example,
there was a 30 percent increase

00:01:37.950 --> 00:01:40.450
in the number of cases
of domestic violence.

00:01:40.690 --> 00:01:42.190
And in Argentina,

00:01:42.240 --> 00:01:45.140
emergency calls
from domestic violence cases

00:01:45.170 --> 00:01:47.310
increased by 25 percent.

00:01:47.580 --> 00:01:50.310
In the first two weeks
of the lockdown in Lagos State,

00:01:50.620 --> 00:01:53.590
our emergency phone lines rang nonstop,

00:01:53.610 --> 00:01:57.510
and we recorded
a 64 percent increase in calls

00:01:57.550 --> 00:02:00.590
from women trapped at home
with their abusers,